WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.253 --> 00:00:06.895
"Rocket Girl!"

2
00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.742
Wukong said, pulling out his iron bar.

3
00:00:17.443 --> 00:00:19.424
The crowd broke apart as people ran away.

4
00:00:20.365 --> 00:00:22.647
Wukong leaped, and Roxy got ready to fight.

5
00:00:22.667 --> 00:00:29.832
"Ouch!" Wukong suddenly fell and rolled around, holding his head tightly and crying.

6
00:00:30.952 --> 00:00:33.213
Roxy noticed the Tang Monk speaking softly.

7
00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:35.495
"What's going on?"

8
00:00:35.875 --> 00:00:36.355
she thought.

9
00:00:36.375 --> 00:00:41.798
"Master, please stop—I'm sorry!"

10
00:00:42.259 --> 00:00:43.159
Wukong cried.

11
00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:48.342
The Tang Monk stopped speaking, and Wukong took a deep breath and stood up.

12
00:00:51.444 --> 00:00:53.205
Slowly he approached the Tang Monk.

13
00:00:54.405 --> 00:00:55.926
The Tang Monk folded his arms.

14
00:00:55.946 --> 00:00:58.528
"You should be ashamed of yourself."

15
00:00:59.552 --> 00:01:01.013
Wukong stared at the ground.

16
00:01:04.395 --> 00:01:05.235
Bajie giggled.

17
00:01:05.255 --> 00:01:11.359
"Do the Tight Headband spell again, Master—Wukong deserves it!"

18
00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:14.220
The Tang Monk glared at Bajie.

19
00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:17.222
"You should be ashamed too, Bajie.

20
00:01:17.742 --> 00:01:19.723
You can't just take over a city like this.

21
00:01:20.203 --> 00:01:20.884
It's wrong."

22
00:01:23.365 --> 00:01:28.408
"You two are truly awful sometimes," Wujing said.

23
00:01:29.496 --> 00:01:30.096
"I agree!"

24
00:01:30.537 --> 00:01:31.197
Roxy said.

25
00:01:31.217 --> 00:01:37.060
"I'm sorry, Master, but sometimes it's hard to be good," Wukong said.

26
00:01:38.061 --> 00:01:41.423
"You must learn to control yourself," the Tang Monk said.

27
00:01:42.923 --> 00:01:45.865
Mayor Bloom approached the monk and Wukong, looking nervous.

28
00:01:45.885 --> 00:01:48.506
"Are you in charge here?"

29
00:01:48.787 --> 00:01:49.827
the Tang Monk asked.

30
00:01:50.547 --> 00:01:51.308
The mayor nodded.

31
00:01:51.988 --> 00:01:53.029
The Tang Monk bowed.

32
00:01:53.049 --> 00:01:58.732
"I apologize for the trouble my companions caused, and I hope you will forgive them."

33
00:02:00.276 --> 00:02:03.178
"Sorry," Wukong and Bajie mumbled.

34
00:02:04.159 --> 00:02:05.340
Mayor Bloom cleared his throat.

35
00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:08.762
"I accept your apology."

36
00:02:09.843 --> 00:02:11.544
Wukong turned to the Tang Monk.

37
00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:13.345
"I'll be right back, Master."

38
00:02:15.346 --> 00:02:17.328
Wukong hurried to police headquarters.

39
00:02:18.628 --> 00:02:20.570
All the police officers were behind bars.

40
00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:22.871
"Release the prisoners!"

41
00:02:23.291 --> 00:02:23.892
he demanded.

42
00:02:24.913 --> 00:02:28.855
A chimpanzee guard unlocked the jail cells, and the officers stepped out.

43
00:02:32.764 --> 00:02:35.025
Detective Smith gave Wukong a suspicious look.

44
00:02:35.765 --> 00:02:37.406
"What's going on, Wukong?"

45
00:02:37.426 --> 00:02:43.348
"I'm not king anymore, so Mayor Bloom can go back to ruling this kingdom," Wukong said.

46
00:02:44.008 --> 00:02:45.128
Detective Smith frowned.

47
00:02:45.148 --> 00:02:47.769
"It's not a kingdom."

48
00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:52.470
Back at City Hall, Wukong opened the portal.

49
00:02:55.091 --> 00:02:57.072
"Return to the Fruit and Flower Mountain!"

50
00:02:57.552 --> 00:02:58.372
he told his army.

51
00:03:04.672 --> 00:03:07.654
Roxy was talking to the Tang Monk, Bajie, and Wujing.

52
00:03:08.835 --> 00:03:10.656
Terrell, Mara, and Jack hurried over.

53
00:03:10.676 --> 00:03:12.697
"Rocket Girl!"

54
00:03:13.017 --> 00:03:13.657
Terrell said.

55
00:03:13.677 --> 00:03:15.418
"It's great to see you!"

56
00:03:15.438 --> 00:03:18.500
"You saved Metro City again!"

57
00:03:19.001 --> 00:03:19.581
Mara said.

58
00:03:21.042 --> 00:03:21.842
Roxy laughed.

59
00:03:21.862 --> 00:03:26.025
"Actually, the Tang Monk saved the city."

60
00:03:27.045 --> 00:03:29.487
"It's nice to meet you all," the Tang Monk said.

61
00:03:34.240 --> 00:03:35.381
He called to Wukong.

62
00:03:39.364 --> 00:03:41.186
"We must continue our journey now!"

63
00:03:42.947 --> 00:03:45.349
Rumble! Someone's stomach growled.

64
00:03:46.370 --> 00:03:47.531
The Tang Monk groaned.

65
00:03:47.551 --> 00:03:52.094
"Bajie! Do you ever stop thinking about food?"

66
00:03:53.395 --> 00:03:54.336
Bajie snorted.

67
00:03:54.356 --> 00:03:57.559
"It wasn't me!"

68
00:03:57.579 --> 00:04:01.662
"Of course it was you," Wukong said.

69
00:04:03.063 --> 00:04:03.944
Wujing nodded.

70
00:04:04.584 --> 00:04:07.186
"You're always hungry, Bajie."

71
00:04:08.207 --> 00:04:09.627
Bajie held up his hands.

72
00:04:09.648 --> 00:04:15.051
"But—but—" "It was actually me," Mara said.

73
00:04:15.071 --> 00:04:16.472
"I'm hungry."

74
00:04:17.673 --> 00:04:18.894
Bajie snorted again.

75
00:04:18.914 --> 00:04:21.635
"I told you it wasn't me!

76
00:04:22.336 --> 00:04:23.317
I am hungry though."

77
00:04:24.838 --> 00:04:25.618
Everyone laughed.

78
00:04:27.279 --> 00:04:29.601
"Let's have a picnic in the park," Jack said.

79
00:04:29.621 --> 00:04:32.042
"Afterward you can continue your journey."

80
00:04:33.003 --> 00:04:34.204
The Tang Monk smiled.

81
00:04:34.972 --> 00:04:35.933
"That sounds nice."

82
00:04:38.795 --> 00:04:42.418
After buying sandwiches at a deli, everyone headed into Metro City Park.

83
00:04:44.980 --> 00:04:47.402
As they sat down, dark clouds rolled overhead.

84
00:04:49.404 --> 00:04:50.865
Boom! Boom!

85
00:04:51.686 --> 00:04:52.947
Lightning lit up the sky.

86
00:04:53.587 --> 00:04:54.868
Raindrops began to fall.

87
00:04:56.190 --> 00:04:57.511
Terrell's shoulders slumped.

88
00:04:57.531 --> 00:04:59.552
"Now we can't have a picnic.

89
00:05:00.093 --> 00:05:01.134
A storm is coming!"

90
00:05:02.375 --> 00:05:03.896
"That's not a storm."

91
00:05:04.544 --> 00:05:06.308
Wukong pulled out his iron bar.

92
00:05:06.328 --> 00:05:09.855
"It's an army of demons!"
